<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">今天也一起守护白菜</view><view class="title">{{role==='child'?'加油，小朋友！':'家长今日看板'}}</view><view class="card top"><text>🥬 {{cabbages}} 颗白菜</text><text>🔥 连续 {{streak}} 天</text></view><view class="title small">今日任务</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view><view class="task">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.detail}}</view></view><text class="status">{{item.status==='todo'?'等待完成':item.status==='submitted'?'等待确认':'已守护'}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{role==='child'&&item.status==='todo'}}" class="button" bindtap="submit" data-id="{{item.id}}">我完成啦</button><button wx:if="{{role!=='child'&&item.status==='submitted'}}" class="button" bindtap="confirm" data-id="{{item.id}}">确认并奖励白菜</button></view><view class="tip">🐻 21:00 若还有未完成任务，小熊只会偷走一颗白菜。明天再一起赢回来！</view></view>
